{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If a number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/4/784111a8e0087c82ade490335852f0c7518b7af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N,N \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" />, diminished by four times its reciprocal, equals a given real constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, then, for this given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, the sum of all such possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/529fb46ff02d390d7920af872fccdac6f61a9b2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{1}{R}\\quad \\text{(B) } R\\quad \\text{(C) } 4\\quad \\text{(D) } \\frac{1}{4}\\quad \\text{(E) } -R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"309\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Write an equation from the given information.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5033ecb13da31354292f779672838e5eaa4850.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N - \\frac{4}{N} = R\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/3/1435badee44fa7f4077646f2b90a169ef1e38be9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N^2 - 4 = RN\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe5c2eaf4ffca9eeb028886b192760af3357e343.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N^2 - RN - 4 = 0\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"15\" />\nBy <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>, the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> for a given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbo